#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:73
#: 09170c1ec61e4a52a5c12caed4139906
msgid ""
"Setting the trim value of the Servo output is important to ensuring that the"
" integrator offset of the tail rotor control loop is minimized, to maximize "
"control range.  Collective to tailrotor compensation can also help with this"
" and is discussed below."
msgstr ""
"设置舵机输出的配平值对于确保尾旋翼控制回路的积分器偏移最小化以最大化控制范围非常重要。总距到尾旋翼的补偿也可以帮助实现这一点，将在下面讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:76
#: 07dae284f16445f2befdf0fa2d1d5352
msgid "For DDFP tails using V4.5 or later"
msgstr "对于使用 V4.5 或更高版本的 DDFP 尾翼"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:78
#: 3aae08db96744e5693b660922e320128
msgid ""
"If no :ref:`collective-to-tailrotor-compensation` is used, then it is "
"recommended that the :ref:`H_YAW_TRIM<H_YAW_TRIM>` parameter is set to "
"minimize the yaw I term in the hover.  To determine this:"
msgstr ""
"如果不使用 :ref:`collective-to-tailrotor-compensation`，建议设置 "
":ref:`H_YAW_TRIM<H_YAW_TRIM>` 参数以最小化悬停中的偏航 I 项。确定方法如下："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:80
#: 096fea3742e84f528cb66c89294f0f57
msgid ""
"Ensure PID logging is switched on in the :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` "
"parameter."
msgstr "确保在 :ref:`LOG_BITMASK<LOG_BITMASK>` 参数中打开了 PID 日志记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:81
#: 2178c8b39be84dd6a6767381838c079a
msgid ""
"Hover the aircraft, maintaining altitude.  For best results, this is "
"preferentially done on a light wind day. If possible, leave the aircraft "
"drift with the wind and mintain a fixed height (ALT HOLD is very useful for "
"this)."
msgstr "悬停飞行器，保持高度。为获得最佳结果，最好在微风天进行。如果可能，让飞行器随风漂移并保持固定高度（AltHold 对此非常有用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:82
#: a74227a34252445c9072ada4e2ef7b6a
msgid ""
"After the flight, download the log and find the ``PIDY.I`` message.  Zoom in"
" the on that portion of the flight with the hovering (should be a relatively"
" flat line). Determine the average value of the I term. Enter this average "
"value in the :ref:`H_YAW_TRIM<H_YAW_TRIM>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"飞行后，下载日志并查找 ``PIDY.I`` 消息。放大悬停飞行部分（应为相对平坦的线）。确定 I 项的平均值。将此平均值输入 "
":ref:`H_YAW_TRIM<H_YAW_TRIM>` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:83
#: 842334ee0ef64941924660c1234fee0b
msgid ""
"To confirm this has been done correctly repeat the flight.  Now, in the "
"hovering portion of the flight, the yaw I Term should be close to zero."
msgstr "重复飞行以确认此操作正确。现在在飞行的悬停部分，偏航 I 项应接近零。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:85
#: a11f18af1cd246c082e7ed27e5165c3d
msgid ""
"If :ref:`collective-to-tailrotor-compensation` is used, then set the "
":ref:`H_YAW_TRIM<H_YAW_TRIM>` sufficient to compensate for the main rotor "
"zero blade pitch drag."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 :ref:`collective-to-tailrotor-compensation`，则将 "
":ref:`H_YAW_TRIM<H_YAW_TRIM>` 设置为足以补偿主旋翼零桨叶螺距阻力的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:88
#: 45f48774af6c4182a91b5ab3141fb5e2
msgid "Other Tail Types and DDFP using firmware before V4.5"
msgstr "其他尾翼类型和 V4.5 之前固件的 DDFP"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:90
#: a5c11a7bbd1545d3a53e4c9b9c9cbe96
msgid ""
"If no :ref:`collective-to-tailrotor-compensation` is used,  then it is "
"recommended that the ``SERVOx_TRIM`` for the tailrotor servo is set to the "
"PWM that corresponds to the tailrotor pitch required for hover, or the motor"
" speed for DDFP. To determine this, hover the aircraft.  After the flight, "
"pull the log and determine the average PWM value for the servo for hovering "
"flight.  Either set that as the ``SERVOx_TRIM`` or mechanically adjust the "
"tail pitch (non-DDFP tail types) for the tail pitch corresponding to the "
"PWM.  Then set the ``SERVOx_TRIM`` to the servo midpoint. The latter "
"approach is usually preferable."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用 :ref:`collective-to-tailrotor-compensation`，建议将尾旋翼舵机的 ``SERVOx_TRIM`` "
"设置为对应悬停所需尾旋翼螺距或 DDFP 电机转速的 PWM。确定方法是悬停飞行器。飞行后，调取日志并确定悬停飞行期间舵机的平均 PWM 值。将其设为 "
"``SERVOx_TRIM``，或机械调整尾桨螺距（非 DDFP 尾翼类型）以对应该 PWM 的尾桨螺距。然后将 ``SERVOx_TRIM`` "
"设置为舵机中点。后一种方法通常更优。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:92
#: 0ec845981a1443528422b7654338a57b
msgid ""
"If If no :ref:`collective-to-tailrotor-compensation` is used,  the set the "
"``SERVOx_TRIM`` for the PWM that corresponds to zero tailrotor pitch.  Or, "
"the tailrotor pitch can be mechanically adjusted to zero pitch for the servo"
" midpoint."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用 :ref:`collective-to-tailrotor-compensation`，则将 ``SERVOx_TRIM`` "
"设为对应零尾旋翼螺距的 PWM。或者，尾旋翼螺距可以机械调整为舵机中点时的零螺距。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:97
#: 86ee7c6343424b2eb8f12359f08c2802
msgid "Collective to Tailrotor Compensation"
msgstr "总距到尾旋翼补偿"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:99
#: ac3dda4dd97f40c280d955d8cdd9ae71
msgid ""
"Collective to tailrotor compensation is used to remove the effects of the "
"aircraft momentarily yawing when the collective pitch is changed rapidly and"
" to minimize integrator offsets."
msgstr "总距到尾旋翼补偿用于消除快速改变总距时飞行器瞬间偏航的影响，并最小化积分器偏移。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:101
#: 841a1c165bd049639c5b990d38df5930
msgid ""
"The parameter :ref:`H_COL2YAW<H_COL2YAW>` is used to set the compensation "
"gain.  This implementation uses an accepted helicopter performance "
"relationship between helicopter power required and weight.  Setting this "
"parameter will only be valid for one rotor speed.  Set the tailrotor pitch "
"so it is zero deg blade pitch at the ``SERVOx_TRIM`` value. If the rotor "
"speed is changed then the parameter might require retuning.  The "
"relationship uses collective to the 1.5 power to determine the tailrotor "
"correction.  It is recommended to start at 0.5 and increase the parameter "
"until there is little to no yawing when changing the collective pitch.  One "
"other way would be to determine the yaw required for hovering as well as the"
" collective and then calculate the value."
msgstr ""
"参数 :ref:`H_COL2YAW<H_COL2YAW>` "
"用于设置补偿增益。此实现使用了关于直升机所需功率与重量之间公认的性能关系。设置此参数只对一个旋翼转速有效。如果旋翼转速改变，参数可能需要重新调参。该关系使用总距的"
" 1.5 次方来确定尾旋翼校正量。建议从 0.5 "
"开始，逐渐增加参数，直到改变总距螺距时偏航很小或没有偏航。另一种方法是确定悬停所需的偏航量和总距，然后计算该值。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:103
#: 47917566ce3e46b6b72abc199e5eee14
msgid "See also: :ref:`traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup`"
msgstr "另见：:ref:`traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup`"
